---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import InteractiveResearchExplainer from '../../components/research/InteractiveResearchExplainer.tsx';
const serverFacts = 'https://github.com/mykcs/zju-server/blob/main/docs/server-facts.md';
const experimentRepo = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment';
---
<AppLayout title="Experiment devices and servers" description="The current OpenEvo experiment uses a 5×RTX5090 allocation; server inventory records 8 visible RTX5090 GPUs. RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 is a historical experiment platform." locale="en">
  <div class="shell editorial-page lab-current-page">
    <header class="page-header lab-intro">
      <span class="section-kicker">Experiment environment · 2026-08-14</span>
      <h1>Experiment devices and servers</h1>
      <p class="lede">The active OpenEvo × WebShop scientific experiment is maintained in <code>openevo-experiment</code> and currently has a <strong>5×RTX5090</strong> allocation. RTX6 with 4×RTX3090 remains only as historical experiment and migration evidence.</p>
    </header>
    <InteractiveResearchExplainer locale="en" kind="server" client:visible />

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="current-server-title">
      <header class="lab-section__heading"><span>CURRENT RECORD</span><h2 id="current-server-title">OpenEvo experiment server</h2></header>
      <dl class="lab-ledger" data-ui-audit="contrast layout">
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Experiment allocation</dt><dd>5× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Visible server inventory</dt><dd>8× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Experiment repository</dt><dd><code>mykcs/openevo-experiment</code></dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Current phase</dt><dd>Phase H0 · Natural Success Search</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="lab-note">Eight visible GPUs is a server-inventory fact; it does not mean every experiment uses all eight. This page shows the current five-GPU experiment allocation.</p>
      <nav class="lab-actions" aria-label="Experiment sources"><a href={serverFacts} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Server facts ↗</a><a href={experimentRepo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Experiment repo ↗</a><a href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}>Experiment results →</a></nav>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="interactive-env-title">
      <header class="lab-section__heading"><span>INTERACTIVE ENVIRONMENT</span><h2 id="interactive-env-title">Interactive development environment</h2></header>
      <p>The interactive command-line environment was verified on <time datetime="2026-08-16">2026-08-16</time>: human SSH sessions enter Fish 4.8.1 while the underlying login shell remains Bash. This provides completion, syntax highlighting, and searchable history without changing the Bash semantics used by non-interactive SSH, file transfer, and Agent automation.</p>

      <div class="lab-shell-paths" data-ui-audit="contrast layout" aria-label="Separate shell paths for interactive work and automation">
        <ol aria-label="Interactive session path">
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>01</span><strong>Interactive session</strong><small>terminal work</small></li>
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>02</span><strong>Guarded bridge</strong><small>interactive sessions only</small></li>
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>03</span><strong>Fish 4.8.1</strong><small>completion · highlighting · autosuggestion</small></li>
        </ol>
        <ol aria-label="Automation path">
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>01</span><strong>Automation call</strong><small>commands · transfer · Agents</small></li>
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>02</span><strong>Bridge skipped</strong><small>no interactive Fish startup</small></li>
          <li data-ui-audit-item><span>03</span><strong>Bash compatibility</strong><small>stable scripting semantics</small></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <dl class="lab-ledger" data-ui-audit="contrast layout">
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Prompt</dt><dd>Starship 1.26.0 · Catppuccin Mocha</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Command history</dt><dd>Atuin 18.19.0 · <code>Ctrl-R</code> search</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Navigation & search</dt><dd>zoxide · fzf · eza · bat · rg · fd</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Long-running work</dt><dd>tmux 3.2a · btop</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Fish interaction</dt><dd>autosuggestion · syntax highlighting · completion</dd></div>
        <div data-ui-audit-item><dt>Compatibility boundary</dt><dd>non-interactive SSH, scp, rsync, and Agent automation stay Bash-compatible</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="lab-note">This public page exposes only the safe interaction model and compatibility design. Login endpoints, hostnames, accounts, keys, and other operational details remain in the private server source of truth.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="history-server-title">
      <header class="lab-section__heading"><span>HISTORICAL LINEAGE</span><h2 id="history-server-title">RTX6 · 4×RTX3090</h2></header>
      <p>RTX6 previously handled WebShop / ALFWorld bring-up, early OpenEvo parameter experiments, and extensive engineering debugging. Its logs, failure traces, and migration evidence remain in <code>seed3090</code> and historical run records, but it no longer represents current experiment hardware.</p>
      <ol class="lab-lineage" data-ui-audit="contrast layout"><li data-ui-audit-item><span>01</span><strong>seed3090</strong><p>RTX6 engineering and early experiment archive</p></li><li data-ui-audit-item><span>02</span><strong>openevo-webshop</strong><p>WebShop × SD-LoRA migration repository</p></li><li data-ui-audit-item><span>03</span><strong>openevo-experiment</strong><p>Current formal experimental source of truth</p></li></ol>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
      <header class="lab-section__heading"><span>ENTRY POINTS</span><h2 id="paths-title">Experiment pages</h2></header>
      <nav class="lab-route-list" aria-label="Experiment pages"><a href={localePath('en','/guide/openevo-webshop-alfworld/')}><span>01</span><strong>Reproduction guide</strong><small>Current server, WebShop contract, and Phase H0</small></a><a href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/experiment/')}><span>02</span><strong>Experiment entry</strong><small>OpenEvo × WebShop data flow</small></a><a href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}><span>03</span><strong>Experiment results</strong><small>Phase D–F, Phase G, and historical evidence</small></a></nav>
    </section>
  </div>
</AppLayout>
<style>
.lab-current-page{--lab-rule:color-mix(in srgb,var(--line) 88%,transparent);padding-bottom:5rem}.lab-intro{max-width:920px;padding-bottom:.5rem}.lab-section{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 1rem));margin:3.6rem auto 0;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-section__heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:1.15rem}.lab-section__heading>span{color:var(--muted);font:800 .56rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.lab-section__heading h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2vw,1.55rem)}.lab-section>p{max-width:78ch;line-height:1.7}.lab-ledger{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin:0;border-block:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-ledger>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr);gap:.8rem;padding:.9rem .2rem}.lab-ledger>div:nth-child(odd){padding-right:1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-ledger>div:nth-child(even){padding-left:1rem}.lab-ledger>div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-ledger dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem}.lab-ledger dd{margin:0;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:750;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.lab-note{margin:.8rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}.lab-actions{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.lab-actions a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;text-underline-offset:.2em}.lab-shell-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin:1.2rem 0 1rem}.lab-shell-paths ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin:0;padding:0;border-block:1px solid var(--lab-rule);list-style:none}.lab-shell-paths li{min-width:0;padding:.85rem .75rem .85rem 0}.lab-shell-paths li+li{padding-left:.75rem;border-left:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-shell-paths span{display:block;color:var(--accent-deep);font:850 .54rem/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.lab-shell-paths strong{display:block;margin:.45rem 0 .25rem;font-size:.76rem}.lab-shell-paths small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.66rem;line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.lab-lineage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin:1.2rem 0 0;padding:0;border-block:1px solid var(--lab-rule);list-style:none}.lab-lineage li{position:relative;padding:1rem .9rem 1rem 0}.lab-lineage li+li{padding-left:1rem;border-left:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-lineage span{display:block;color:var(--accent-deep);font:850 .54rem/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.lab-lineage strong{display:block;margin:.45rem 0 .3rem;font-size:.8rem}.lab-lineage p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.45}.lab-route-list{display:grid;border-block:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-route-list a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px minmax(150px,.55fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.75rem;align-items:center;min-height:58px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.lab-route-list a+a{border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-route-list a>span{color:var(--accent-deep);font:850 .56rem/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.lab-route-list strong{font-size:.78rem}.lab-route-list small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem}.lab-route-list a:hover strong,.lab-route-list a:focus-visible strong{color:var(--accent-deep)}@media(max-width:900px){.lab-shell-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:720px){.lab-section{width:100%;margin-top:2.8rem}.lab-section__heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.35rem}.lab-ledger{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-ledger>div,.lab-ledger>div:nth-child(odd),.lab-ledger>div:nth-child(even){padding:.8rem .1rem;border-right:0}.lab-ledger>div+div{border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-shell-paths ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-shell-paths li,.lab-shell-paths li+li{padding:.75rem .1rem;border-left:0}.lab-shell-paths li+li{border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-lineage{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-lineage li,.lab-lineage li+li{padding:.9rem .1rem;border-left:0}.lab-lineage li+li{border-top:1px solid var(--lab-rule)}.lab-route-list a{grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:.45rem .6rem;padding:.75rem 0}.lab-route-list small{grid-column:2}}
</style>
